From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: office <office@localhost>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] ui-egui: plugin UI hook (side panels and text context menu
 items drawn by the extension)

Phase 7 WP3 (docs/phase7/PLAN.md sections 4.5 and 9). `office_overlay::set_plugin_ui(panel, context)` registers two functions of the extension crate. `panes::show` calls `plugin_panel` (the plugins' egui side panels), the text context menu calls `plugin_context` after the Transliterate submenu and runs the command it returns. Without the extension both are no-ops, so upstream behaviour is unchanged. The desktop app registers docs-office's re-exports of docs-plugins.
---
  apps/wordcraft/src/main.rs           |  2 ++
  crates/ui-egui/src/canvas.rs         |  5 +++++
  crates/ui-egui/src/office_overlay.rs | 20 ++++++++++++++++++++
  crates/ui-egui/src/panes.rs          |  2 ++
  4 files changed, 29 insertions(+)

